undant natural light. The main level offers a spacious living room, flex room, bedroom, dining area, kitchen, 2-piece bath with laundry, and a rear foyer leading to the fully fenced yard. Enjoy the covered porch, ground-level patio, and detached single garage with lane access. Upstairs you’ll find two bedrooms with charming angled ceilings, a renovated 4-piece bath, and a primary bedroom with patio doors opening to a private balcony. Updated trim, doors, windows, and bathrooms add to the appeal. The untouched basement is ready for your vision. Situated on a large lot just minutes to downtown and close to the LRT, this is a true character home you won’t want to miss. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$279,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,426 sq ft"],["Year built","1921"],["Storeys","1.5"],["Neighbourhood","Eastwood"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5B2N6"],["MLS® number","E4510295"],["Listed","September 24, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Gas stove(s), Dishwasher, Dryer, Hood Fan, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Carport"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Family room","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 3","Main level",""]],"courtesy":"Nicole McFatridge, Sarasota Realty and Ryan Boser, Sarasota Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"eastwood","area":"central-edmonton"}